            "description": "Starts a simulation with the given name. You must choose to start your simulation from a schema or from a snapshot. For more information about the schema, see the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/simspaceweaver/latest/userguide/schema-reference.html\">schema reference</a> in the <i>SimSpace Weaver User Guide</i>. For more information about snapshots, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/simspaceweaver/latest/userguide/working-with_snapshots.html\">Snapshots</a> in the <i>SimSpace Weaver User Guide</i>."
